<title>UK: British condom maker Durex launches on-line forum.</title>
<headline>British condom maker Durex launches on-line forum.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Durex, one of the world's leading condom makers, on Monday launched an on-line sexual health forum on the worldwide computer web.</p>
<p>It said the website would contain up-to-the-minute scientific and medical data on contraception, sexual health issues, research and an inter-active forum.</p>
<p>&quot;The Forum of the Quarter is breaking new ground in scientific condom information by linking experts from around the world instantaneously,&quot; Vincent Jeanniard, a spokesman for the firm which is part of London International Group Plc, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
